---
import Trade90V2Layout from "../../layouts/Trade90V2Layout.astro";
import {lessons} from "../../data/v2-lessons.js";
---
<Trade90V2Layout title="Learn About Interest Rate Gaps" description="Clear educational guides explaining central bank rates, forex interest-rate divergence, expectations and currency risks." canonical="/learn/">
<main class="wrap">
 <header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">Trade90 learning guides</span><h1>Understand Central Bank Rate Gaps</h1><p>Practical, source-linked explanations to help you interpret the rate comparison tool without confusing interest-rate differences with currency price predictions.</p></header>
 <div class="articles">
 {lessons.map(lesson=><a class="linkcard" href={"/learn/"+lesson.slug+"/"}><strong>{lesson.title}</strong><p>{lesson.description}</p><span>Read article →</span></a>)}
 </div>
 <div class="note"><strong>Start with the live comparison table:</strong> <a href="/">Compare all 28 current forex rate gaps →</a></div>
<section class="article"><h2>A practical reading order</h2><p>Begin with the interest-rate divergence guide to understand the difference between a signed gap and an absolute gap. Then read about expected rate gaps to separate published policy decisions from prices implied by market instruments. The guide on currency strength explains why a higher interest rate alone is not enough to predict an exchange rate.</p><p>Apply these ideas to a <a href="/pairs/">currency-pair research page</a>. Identify the two central banks, check the dates of their selected policy benchmarks and compare the economic observations. Follow the original sources when a decision or a data release matters to your research. Our <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> explains the calculation conventions used across the site.</p><p>These guides are educational. They do not recommend a position, promise a return or replace your own assessment of risk. An unavailable forecast is shown as unavailable rather than filled with an assumed rate path.</p></section>
</main>
</Trade90V2Layout>
<style>.articles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px;margin:12px 0 30px}.articles strong{display:block;font-size:1.1rem}.articles span{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;color:#93c5fd}.note{background:#152739;color:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #334155;border-radius:12px;padding:22px;margin:15px 0 40px}@media(max-width:800px){.articles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
